  "content": "\n\n<h1>Maid Restaurant 女僕餐廳</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>為《東方小麥》（Touhou Little Maid）設計的擴充模組，讓女僕能夠自動烹飪與服務食物。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>![Minecraft](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fMinecraft-Java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java</a> 版-亮綠色) ![Forge](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/</a> Forge | NeoForge  -1.20.1 | 1.21.1-橘色) ![License](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fLicense-BSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/License-BSD</a> -藍色)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RTiyYo0U/images/af8ed07134840c6b8c169185f185101bbbf50825.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></p>\n<h2>簡介</h2>\n<p>本模組專為《我的世界》Java 版開發。致力於透過女僕團隊合作，提供餐廳風格的自動化體驗。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>女僕在烹飪與上菜時的團隊合作。</li>\n<li>支援模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers' Delight</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakeries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bakeries</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/blob/main/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSD 三項條款授權</a></p>\n<h2>反饋與建議</h2>\n<p>如果您在使用過程中遇到問題或有改進建議，請透過以下管道與我們聯繫：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🐛 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 提交錯誤回報</li>\n<li>💡 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 功能建議、討論與交流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>開發者</h2>\n<p><strong>KomeijiMarisa</strong></p>",
